# The private half of the backlog.
#
# backlog.md is a notepad in a PUBLIC repository. Anything about THIS host that
# a stranger could use — addresses, ports, what is open today, which hardening
# is still outstanding — belongs in the local file and nowhere else. Written
# during E4a, after three such lines had been put in the tracked one.
backlog.local.md

